{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_01",
      "hash": "cab3e0ff3ae74cc6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿桔「……哈！哈！哈！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_06",
      "hash": "cab3e3ff3ae751df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "像[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這樣的稚子，\\n竟膽敢向在下挑戰，\\r\\n簡直是可笑至極！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_07",
      "hash": "cab3e2ff3ae7502c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……令對手束手無策，\\n在劇毒中自趨滅亡……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_08",
      "hash": "cab3e9ff3ae75c11",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳見識一下\\n忍術的奧妙之處吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_gym06_01_02",
      "hash": "7f14c616ef4033a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_02",
      "hash": "cab3dfff3ae74b13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂！\\n收下這個粉紅徽章！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8050_sys_01",
      "hash": "524a709f73eb2021",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從阿桔那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]粉紅徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_03",
      "hash": "cab3deff3ae74960",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了粉紅徽章，\\n無論是從誰那裡得到的寶可夢，\\r\\n只要等級在[VAR NUM2(0004)]以下，\\r\\n寶可夢都會聽命於[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\c\\n對了……！這東西也給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8050_sys_02",
      "hash": "524a6d9f73eb1b08",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從阿桔那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_04",
      "hash": "cab3e5ff3ae75545",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是在下的家族裡\\n代代相傳了400年的寶可夢招式。\\c\\n在這招式學習器27裡，\\n封印著絕招「劇毒」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_05",
      "hash": "cab3e4ff3ae75392",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "「劇毒」會使對手在中毒後，\\n每回合都受到比前一回合\\r\\n更大的中毒傷害！\\c\\n這是個能讓對手\\n感受到恐怖的招式。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8050_max",
      "hash": "c23e3cae6b9334b6"
    }
  ]
}
